{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Step Can Change Everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOKES on BLOCKS! </strong>is a fast-paced, easy-to-pick-up party action game with simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players* and knock each other off the stage. Last bloke standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild stage gimmicks and unpredictable items bring chaos and excitement to every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes down to timing and mind games! Outmaneuver your opponents one block at a time and be the last one standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local matches support up to 4 players, while online matches support up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also add bots to fill any empty slots if desired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the directional pad to move up, down, left, or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically perform actions depending on the terrain ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries about ledges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most out-of-shape bloke can climb a one-block height with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Attack by Moving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move into a space occupied by another player, you\u2019ll knock them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the opponent is already downed, your attack will send them flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking hits increases your damage count making you easier to launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your damage gauge near your feet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Comebacks Are a Strategy Too</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting knocked out of the arena isn\u2019t the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, respawning is an opportunity to counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a flashy return and let everyone know you\u2019re not the type to go down easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.poster.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.webm?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.mp4?t=1768716392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll be waiting for you on top of the blocks, with a bunch of quirky ol' blokes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/93b79344c8641dab33925cd247387da7.avif?t=1768716392\" width=600 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757020?t=1768716392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757020?t=1768716392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/740c4d563d4f85d6522d5730df8b5f952123f0b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768716392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/740c4d563d4f85d6522d5730df8b5f952123f0b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768716392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3966230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Step Can Change Everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f